  message: "Investigated 2026-06-01 for cluster context. Parent set to INV-nuzal (P2 violated, edge.provenance / edge.quality / node.quality 100% empty). Per WI-latup's description: 'Closes the tail of INV-luhur sub-pattern-4 / INV-nuzal.' Phase 1 PR2 added Edge.derived_from to the IR; ~22% of edges populated post-Phase-6, leaving ~85K edges without linker-derivation provenance. WI-latup is the per-linker construction-site sweep (~20 linker files). The writer-contract validator doesn't currently flag this because it only fires on never-populated-by-anyone fields — derived_from is populated by SOME linkers, just not all. Doesn't duplicate any preexisting row — it's the direct tail of INV-nuzal."  # 3006
